# TOOL-009 – Document Parser Tool

## 1. Purpose

The Document Parser Tool is responsible for extracting textual content and document metadata from supported file formats during the document ingestion process.

It converts heterogeneous enterprise documents into a normalized text representation that can be processed by downstream AI components, including the Document Chunker Tool and Embedding Tool.

The Document Parser Tool serves as the first stage of the document ingestion pipeline.

---

## 2. Responsibilities

The Document Parser Tool is responsible for:

- Detecting document format.
- Extracting textual content.
- Extracting document metadata.
- Normalizing extracted text.
- Handling supported document types.
- Reporting parsing errors.
- Returning structured parsing results.

The Document Parser Tool does not split documents into chunks or generate embeddings.

