## 18. Design Principles

The Document Parser Tool follows these principles:

- Format independence.
- Stateless execution.
- Extensible parser architecture.
- Secure document processing.
- Consistent normalized output.
- Separation of parsing and chunking responsibilities.

---

## 19. Success Criteria

The Document Parser Tool is considered successful when:

- Supported documents are parsed successfully.
- Text is extracted accurately.
- Metadata is captured correctly.
- Unsupported documents are rejected gracefully.
- Output is normalized for downstream processing.

